{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_247_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_247","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_247_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_247","textTraditional":"十九年春，越人侵楚，以誤吳也。夏，楚公子慶、公孫寬追越師，至冥，不及，乃還。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_247_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_247","textTraditional":"秋，楚沈諸梁伐東夷，三夷男女及楚師盟于敖。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_247_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_247","textTraditional":"冬，叔青如京師，敬王崩故也。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}